<p dir="auto">This PR is a demo of moving the <code class="notranslate">{{apiref(.*)}}</code> macro into front matter.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Move <code class="notranslate">APIRef</code> into front matter</li>
<li>Update front matter schema to allow for both strings or a list of items which accept string args</li>
</ul>
