<p dir="auto">I have made the replacements across the entire <code class="notranslate">files/en-us/web/api/**/*</code> section for <code class="notranslate">APIRef</code>, which touches 7,000+ files. This PR is a small example on a subset of files so we can show that it works as expected with different parameter formats (with/without whitespace, without params).</p>
<p dir="auto">For the full <code class="notranslate">APIRef</code> changes, see:</p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/compare/main...bsmth:content:api-sidebar?expand=1">https://github.com/mdn/content/compare/main...bsmth:content:api-sidebar?expand=1</a></p>
